      "cat-harness:section": "comment before Collab_SessionStateMachine",
      "prov:value": "The owner, 2026-09-20: \"an agent could also play a (non-deterministic) state machine as a tool. managing state (kinda) during human/agentic discussion. this should be a workflow.\"",
