    {
      "@id": "processes/process/session-state-machine.bpmn#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "comment before Collab_SessionStateMachine",
      "prov:value": "That distinction is the whole design, and it needed no change to the engine — an exclusive gateway with no `cat-harness.processes:decision` was ALREADY the case where the caller supplies the outcome."
    },
    {
      "@id": "processes/process/session-state-machine.bpmn#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "comment before Collab_SessionStateMachine",
      "prov:value": "WHAT DID NEED ADDING is `<cat-harness.processes:judgement reason=\"…\"/>`. Without it, \"no table because this is somebody's call\" and \"no table because nobody wrote one yet\" are indistinguishable — the gap `cat-harness.processes:no-skill` closed for activities, one element type along."
    }
